{"text":"[exasperated] “Já ficou pronto?” Três vezes hoje. [sighs] E aí você larga a chave dez pra atender. [calmly] Não é pressa, cara. [empathetic] Ele só não sabe o que tão fazendo com o Gol dele, sabe? [confident] No BoxMonitor, cada etapa vira status. Recebido. Diagnóstico. Orçamento. Foto da pastilha do Gol, ele aprova pelo celular. Chega por e-mail e notificação. [upbeat] Terminou? Marca pronto pra retirar. [warmly] Cadastre sua oficina pelo link da bio. [relieved] E ele para de ligar pra saber se ficou pronto.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"model\":\"eleven_v4\",\"stability\":0.3,\"similarity_boost\":0.8}","seconds":28.48,"charStarts":[0,0.023,0.026,0.029,0.031,0.034,0.038,0.042,0.046,0.049,0.051,0.054,0.057,0.069,0.08,0.12,0.16,0.24,0.32,0.373,0.427,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.72,0.8,0.88,0.96,1.04,1.12,1.2,1.4,1.6,1.68,1.76,1.84,1.92,2,2.16,2.24,2.32,2.4,2.48,2.56,2.64,2.68,2.72,2.8,2.88,3.2,3.52,3.56,3.6,3.68,3.76,3.84,4,4.16,4.2,4.24,4.28,4.32,4.4,4.48,4.56,4.587,4.613,4.64,4.68,4.72,4.76,4.8,4.84,4.88,4.92,4.96,5,5.02,5.04,5.12,5.2,5.28,5.36,5.44,5.52,5.6,5.68,5.707,5.733,5.76,5.8,5.82,5.84,5.904,5.968,6.032,6.096,6.16,6.4,6.64,6.653,6.658,6.662,6.667,6.68,6.687,6.693,6.707,6.72,6.747,6.773,6.8,6.88,6.96,7.12,7.152,7.184,7.216,7.248,7.28,7.36,7.4,7.44,7.6,7.653,7.707,7.76,7.92,8.08,8.103,8.114,8.126,8.131,8.137,8.143,8.149,8.154,8.16,8.166,8.171,8.194,8.217,8.225,8.232,8.24,8.32,8.36,8.4,8.48,8.56,8.6,8.64,8.72,8.8,8.827,8.853,8.88,8.92,8.96,8.987,8.996,9.004,9.013,9.04,9.12,9.16,9.2,9.28,9.36,9.4,9.44,9.48,9.52,9.56,9.6,9.68,9.693,9.707,9.72,9.76,9.8,9.84,9.92,9.96,10,10.08,10.16,10.24,10.28,10.32,10.4,10.507,10.613,10.649,10.684,10.72,11.04,11.053,11.067,11.07,11.073,11.077,11.08,11.083,11.085,11.088,11.091,11.093,11.107,11.12,11.16,11.2,11.36,11.413,11.467,11.52,11.577,11.634,11.691,11.749,11.806,11.863,11.92,12.08,12.12,12.16,12.213,12.267,12.32,12.44,12.5,12.56,12.613,12.667,12.72,12.8,12.88,12.907,12.933,12.96,13.28,13.333,13.387,13.44,13.493